Stumpy - spooky anime-style opponent character for your colorful platformer game/ sidescroller! Mushrooms could be used separately as part of environment)
Modelled in Maya 2016, (3ds Max 2012 version of model is also included)
Suitable for games, mobile apps, mods or any real time applications. This asset is optimized and hand tweaked. The texture is hand-painted using wacom tablet. Total count triangles : 3428 triangles.
Texture resolution : diffuse 1024*1024 tga. (PSD origin file is also included)
Features : 

  - Clean mesh with no co-planar faces or isolated vertices ; 

  - No corrections or cleaning up needed ; 

  - Fully textured ; 

  - Correctly named in English ; 

  - Pivot at 0, 0, 0 at bottom center of object ; 

  - Fbx file ready to drag and drop to any game engines.

Available formats: *.max *.mb *.obj *.fbx

