This set of 3D beetle models features realistic appearance with high-resolution PBR textures (base color, roughness, normal map). It includes:

  - One 4K texture set for the frame;

  - Four 4K textures sets for the beetles (one set is shared between both beetles);

  - Herculeses beetle: 12606 poligons;

  - Rhinoceros beetle: 12584 poligons;

  - Frame for beetles: 323 poligons.

You will receive two unique beetle models with a total four different textures variations. The model are available in OBJ and FBX formats.Feel free to message me if you encounter any issues or have questions.Rendered in Cycles (using OpenGL normal maps). If you require textures sets optimized for V-ray, Corona, or other renderers, please feel free to message me; I can provide them.

This set of 3D beetle models is created with hight-resolution PBR textures for realistic appearance. The model include:

  - Stag beetle: 7324 poligons;

  - Atlas beetle: 7016 poligons;

  - Rhinoceros beetle: 7437 poligons.

The model are available in OBJ and FBX formats. The set of three beetles has a common texture and not separate ones for each of the beetles.Rendered in Cycles (using OpenGL normal maps). If you require textures sets optimized for V-ray, Corona, or other renderers, please feel free to message me; I can provide them.

Realistic 3D model of a male Goliath beetle:

  - Provided in FBX, OBJ, and BLEND 4.0.2 formats;

  - Features detailed PNG textures at 1K, 2K, and 4K resolutions (7z, RAR);

  - The model is not rigged, with a mesh of 26,020 polygons and 45,534 vertices.

